// The three editor-captured variants, reconstructed (the upstream probe was
// deleted once it adjudicated). Each returned CE10059 in the Pine editor,
// 2026-08-25.
//
// `--tv` does NOT reproduce the rule and must not be used to check this file:
// it rejects the two void COMMANDS on ordinary type grounds (void into a
// `series float` parameter) and is CLEAN on the READ, which is the cell only
// the editor adjudicates. See G009, INV161.
//@version=6
strategy("ce10059 three variants")
a = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "60", strategy.entry("L", strategy.long))
b = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "60", strategy.close("L"))
c = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "60", strategy.position_size)
plot(a + b + c)
